{
  "shots": [
    {
      "sentence": "My grandfather always warned me that the basement mirror was a window, not a reflection.",
      "search_term": "old mirror basement",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "An old, dusty antique mirror hanging on a dark basement wall.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_1.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 3.921
    },
    {
      "sentence": "I laughed it off for twenty years until the night I saw my own reflection blink while I stood perfectly still.",
      "search_term": "person looking mirror",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A person staring intensely into a bathroom mirror in low light.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_2.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 4.922
    },
    {
      "sentence": "The air in the room suddenly turned brittle and cold, smelling of wet earth and copper.",
      "search_term": "frost forming cold",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "Close up of frost forming on a dark, cold surface.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_3.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 4.042
    },
    {
      "sentence": "I took a tentative step toward the glass, my heart hammering against my ribs like a trapped bird.",
      "search_term": "hand touching glass",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A person's hand slowly reaching out to touch a glass surface.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_4.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 4.281
    },
    {
      "sentence": "The version of me in the mirror didn't move forward.",
      "search_term": "mirror reflection dark",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A reflection in a mirror that is slightly out of sync with the person standing in front of it.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_5.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 1.941
    },
    {
      "sentence": "Instead, it reached out and gripped the frame from the inside with grey, elongated fingers.",
      "search_term": "hand pressing glass",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A pale, shadowy hand pressing against a glass surface from behind.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_6.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 4.402
    },
    {
      "sentence": "I tried to scream, but my voice was stolen by the heavy, suffocating silence of the room.",
      "search_term": "person scared dark",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A person in a dark room looking terrified and gasping for air.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_7.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 4.223
    },
    {
      "sentence": "The creature stepped through the silver surface with a sound like tearing wet parchment.",
      "search_term": "shadowy figure silhouette",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A dark, distorted figure emerging from a shadowy doorway.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_8.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 3.401
    },
    {
      "sentence": "It stood before me, a perfect, hollow duplicate wearing my clothes and my panicked expression.",
      "search_term": "person standing shadow",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A person standing in the shadows looking exactly like the viewer.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_9.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 4.742
    },
    {
      "sentence": "I braced myself for a struggle, waiting for the violence I was certain would follow.",
      "search_term": "person fists clenched",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A person clenching their fists in a defensive stance.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_10.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 3.462
    },
    {
      "sentence": "But the thing didn't attack.",
      "search_term": "creepy figure standing",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A calm, eerie figure standing still in a dimly lit room.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_11.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 0.921
    },
    {
      "sentence": "It simply walked past me, brushed off its shoulders, and picked up my car keys from the table.",
      "search_term": "keys on table",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A hand picking up a set of metal keys from a wooden table.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_12.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 4.162
    },
    {
      "sentence": "It paused at the door, turning back to offer a pitying, lopsided grin.",
      "search_term": "person doorway smile",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A person standing in a doorway looking back with a sinister smile.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_13.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 3.563
    },
    {
      "sentence": "I realized then that I wasn't being murdered.",
      "search_term": "eyes wide fear",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A close up of a person's eyes widening in realization.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_14.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 1.621
    },
    {
      "sentence": "I was being replaced.",
      "search_term": "person looking hands",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A person looking at their own hands in confusion and horror.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_15.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 0.821
    },
    {
      "sentence": "Before I could lunge, the creature stepped into the mirror and vanished.",
      "search_term": "empty mirror room",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A dark, empty mirror reflecting an empty room.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_16.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 3.123
    },
    {
      "sentence": "Now I spend my days staring at the back of a silver frame, watching a life that used to be mine walk away without me.",
      "search_term": "person sitting mirror",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A person sitting alone in a dark room staring at a mirror.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_17.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 5.264
    }
  ],
